      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "With the gateway: the agent reads NBAS through the adapter and a read-only\ncopy, and drafts; people approve in their own logins; only the gateway writes\ninto NBAS. The 0.5% (Rs.1,19,952) is secured on 16th Oct, and NBAS says paid\nonly after the bank",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "asum",
      "originalText": "With the gateway: the agent reads NBAS through the adapter and a read-only copy, and drafts; people approve in their own logins; only the gateway writes into NBAS. The 0.5% (Rs.1,19,952) is secured on 16th Oct, and NBAS says paid only after the bank",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
