      "text": "[Agent] 8th Oct, daily check: reads open\ninvoices from the read-only copy and\noffers from the gateway. 4471 is clear and\nVoltway offers 0.5% if paid by 17th Oct.\nThe last payment day inside that window is\nFriday 16th Oct (bank file by Thursday\n15th, 6 PM)",
