      "originalText": "[Agent] 8th Oct, daily check: reads open invoices from the read-only copy and offers from the gateway. 4471 is clear and Voltway offers 0.5% if paid by 17th Oct. The last payment day inside that window is Friday 16th Oct (bank file by Thursday 15th, 6 PM)",
