      "text": "[Agent] drafts \"Returned\" in the\ngateway (approval loop) and tells\nPriya, Emma and Vikram the same day. A\nnew supplier account needs a call to\nthe number on file, a Rs.1 test,\nVikram's approval and a 24-hour hold\nbefore an off-cycle re-issue",
