      "originalText": "[Agent] drafts \"Returned\" in the gateway (approval loop) and tells Priya, Emma and Vikram the same day. A new supplier account needs a call to the number on file, a Rs.1 test, Vikram's approval and a 24-hour hold before an off-cycle re-issue",
