      "locked": false,
      "text": "[Gateway] Writes the payment voucher\ninto NBAS through the adapter\n(approval loop); the agent tells\nPriya, and Emma if she handles that\nsupplier. Statement lines it cannot\nmatch go to Priya with its evidence",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "bc_f",
      "originalText": "[Gateway] Writes the payment voucher into NBAS through the adapter (approval loop); the agent tells Priya, and Emma if she handles that supplier. Statement lines it cannot match go to Priya with its evidence",
      "autoResize": true,
