      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Where the tables live now (in CAPSTONE_legacy.md, so this board stays a picture)\n- How the agent and the gateway connect to NBAS, row by row: \"How it connects to NBAS\"\n- What Ledgerline did on its own that NBAS does not, and where it lives now: the next section\n- What stays human: section 1\n- The sandbox and its new traps: section 2\n- The five jobs and where each reads and writes: section 3\n- The never-events and the test scenarios: section 4\n- Guardrails and the red-team tests: section 6\n- What changes without new code: section 7\n- The money for invoice 4471: CAPSTONE_design.md",
